---
description: Core rules for Vecto — always applied
alwaysApply: true
---
- Follow AGENTS.md at the repo root. It overrides anything here if they conflict.
- Work only from a task brief in docs/tasks/. If none is given, ask for one.
- Plan first: list the files you will touch and the service functions you will add, then implement.
- Stay inside the brief's scope. Put anything else under "Open questions" in the PR.
- Never add Co-authored-by / Made-with / any attribution trailer. Never change git user config.
- Run tests before saying a task is done, and paste the result summary in the PR.
